1
00:00:08,631 --> 00:00:09,599
P'…

2
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:14,146
Can I sleep in the small room tonight?

3
00:00:21,435 --> 00:00:24,328
Why? You planning to sneak off
and talk to someone?

4
00:00:25,175 --> 00:00:27,791
P'Gun—are you seriously
picking a fight right now?

5
00:00:29,689 --> 00:00:30,565
I'm sorry.

6
00:00:31,494 --> 00:00:33,848
But I'm pissed you hung up on me, Earth.

7
00:00:34,565 --> 00:00:36,565
Then went off with some senior guy—
what the hell was that?

8
00:00:38,171 --> 00:00:40,910
We were working, okay?
We weren't just sitting around doing nothing.

9
00:00:43,079 --> 00:00:45,803
P'Gun, don't be unreasonable like this.

10
00:00:46,783 --> 00:00:49,984
You should trust me—
because I still trust you.

11
00:00:58,627 --> 00:00:59,487
Okay?

12
00:01:00,828 --> 00:01:02,828
Do I really have to be
the one begging you right now?

13
00:01:03,749 --> 00:01:05,749
I can't believe this.

14
00:01:29,879 --> 00:01:32,341
- What are you doing?
- Well then…

15
00:01:34,687 --> 00:01:36,687
Looks like I'm the one
who has to beg Earth instead.
